  (text "Sallen-Key: 4.95 kHz, Q 0.73\n(DSP: 2nd-order 5 kHz low-pass)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 139.7 66.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f3e52e35-19d1-5f44-a1cc-082c684cfd06"))
  (text "Section 6 of the circuit notes. The pedal's post-clip filtering is not documented; everything here is chosen.\nCX3, RX8: the 5 Hz DC blocker that removes the asymmetric clipper's offset (fi.dcblockerat(5)).\nRX9, RX10, CX4, CX5, UX4: a unity-gain Sallen-Key Butterworth low-pass at 5 kHz (postLP), which tames the fizz\nwhile leaving the Treble control something to act on." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d4febbc7-051b-55ff-8b23-9c27d33aa8e4"))
